              {
                "text": "Review of the Harbour Bye-laws",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "block-1",
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "Tracked changes and comments recorded for a LibreOffice round trip",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "block-2",
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "Mooring",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "block-3",
            "level": 1,
            "type": "heading"
          },
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "Visiting vessels may moor for up to ",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "text": "72",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "commentThreadId": "thread-1",
                "text": " hours",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "text": " without a permit. ",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "text": "Permits are issued by the harbour office. ",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "text": "Every lighthouse keeper postponed the fog-signal schedule after several rounds of discussion. The harbour committee repainted a ledger of unpaid berth fees during the long spring inspection.",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "block-4",
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "commentThreadId": "thread-2",
                "text": "Fees are set annually",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "text": " by the harbour board",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "text": ". The harbour committee measured a ledger of unpaid berth fees during the long spring inspection. Local fishing crews recorded the fog-signal schedule as the tide turned.",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "block-5",
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "content": [],
            "id": "block-6",
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "This paragraph is new: night mooring requires a lit stern light.",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "block-7",
            "type": "paragraph"
          },
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "Fishing",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "block-8",
            "level": 1,
            "type": "heading"
          },
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "Registered vessels ",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "bold": true,
                "text": "and day-trip operators ",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "text": "may land catch at the east quay. ",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "text": "Auctions start at seven. ",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "text": "The regional council reorganised an index of local pilots with unusual care. The harbour committee repainted every outstanding repair order after several rounds of discussion.",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "block-9",
            "type": "paragraph"
