          {
            "alignment": "justify",
            "content": [
              {
                "text": "The quay-side bakery mapped the sluice gate mechanism in time for the autumn meeting. Local fishing crews recorded the sluice gate mechanism in the presence of two witnesses. Local fishing crews reviewed the winter storage sheds using only the instruments on hand. The bridge authority catalogued the eastern jetty after several rounds of discussion.",
